    {
      "heading": "Objectives",
      "level": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Warn Kehanni of Varesh's forces. Destroy the vanguard assaulting the temple. See Head Priest Vahmani for your reward."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Reward",
      "level": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "2,000 Experience 250 Gold 10 Lightbringer Points"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Walkthrough",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "This quest will lead you to Grand Court of Sebelkeh if you don't already have it on your World Map. If you do have it, map travel to it, exit west into the Mirror of Lyss and follow the quest arrow to meet Kehanni nearby.",
        "A mob of Margonites led by the Paragon boss, Overseer Juntahk, are also nearby and as you approach Kehanni, they will start to advance towards her. Defeat the Margonites to continue the quest. It's worth noting that Kehanni is accompanied by three level 20 Lyssan Priests who are monks, staying near them and allowing the Margonites to approach instead, ensures the party can remain fully healed throughout the fight."
      ]
    },
